summary:
Targa Resources Corp.

]HOUSTON, June 19, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Targa Resources Corp. (NYSE: TRGP) ("Targa" or the "Company") announced today that representatives from the Company will present at the J.P. Morgan Energy, Power and Renewables Conference in New York City at 1:35 p.m. Eastern Time (12:35 p.m. Central Time) on Wednesday, June 21, 2023. Representatives from the Company will also participate in investor meetings at the conference on Wednesday, June 21, 2023.

